<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94618" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκά̆φ-η</span></b> , ἡ: <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b>
			<i>trough, tub, basin</i>, or <i>bowl</i> (<i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> only in 
				Dim.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκαφίς</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.73
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ec.</u>
				742
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>kneading-trough</i> or <i>baker's tray</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Timocl.
				33
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				10.102
			</span></i>; <i>wash-tub, bath</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				225
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Steril.</u>
				234
			</span></i>; <i>bowl</i> or <i>tray</i> on which offerings were
			carried by metoeci at the Panathenaea, etc., <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.844.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				22.1388.46
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Semus
				5
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκαφηφόρος</span>: prov., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ σῦκα σῦκα, τὴν σκάφην σκάφην λέγει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Apostol.
					15.95b
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.178b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Hist.Conscr.</u>
				41
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				7.208a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>light boat, skiff</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				1315
			</span></i> (with a pun on signf. <i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				25.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.23.7
			</span></i>; used for cargo, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1742.9
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>; <i>boat-load</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PGrad.</u>
					9.5
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> child's <i>cradle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Po.</u>
				1454b25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phylarch.
				36
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Rom.</u>
				3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.106
			</span></i>, al., Sch. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				138
			</span></i> (prob.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>grave</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BCH</u>
				24.394
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Bithynia</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>concave sun-dial</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Vitr.
				9.8.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cleom.
				1.10
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				6.110
			</span></i>. (Prob. orig. <i>something dug</i> or <i>scooped
			out</i>, fr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκάπτω</span>.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
